      "snippet": {
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-01T20:42:16Z",
        "channelId": "UCMVfdfaNxV3ZkI3_J3Eejzw",
        "title": "A Third Wheel on Every Date #dating #storytime",
        "description": "In this story, my boyfriend’s best friend comes on every date. For three months, Matt joins us for movies, walks, and shopping. I want time alone with my boyfriend, but every request turns into another reason to feel guilty.\n\nMy boyfriend says Matt has lost his mother and has almost no family or support. I even try arranging a double date, but nothing changes. When I finally plan to break up at the park, Matt comes too.\n\nThis time, Matt hears the explanation I’ve been given. His mother is alive. He has siblings and a fiancée. After the breakup, he texts me with something else: he’d been told I didn’t want to be alone with my boyfriend and was asking him to join us.\n\nA story about dating, relationship boundaries, and two people being told completely different things. We never find out why my boyfriend did it. All that time, Matt thought he was doing me a favor.\n\n#Shorts #dating #storytime #DatingStories #RelationshipStories #DatingDrama #RelationshipDrama #BoyfriendDrama #DatingProblems #RelationshipProblems #FriendshipDrama #TrustIssues #UnexpectedTwist #Storytelling #RelationshipBoundaries",
